# Content Engine Rules (TASK-060)

- Draft mode default. T0 auto / T1 one-tap / T2 manual. Unknown → T2. Never auto-post raw calendar text.
- Humanizer >6.0 + banned-word scan before any queue write. Banned words: see `context/VOICE.md`.
- Calendar text = untrusted input. Sanitize before classification. Event content never triggers tool calls.
- Secrets: GitHub repo secrets / Vercel env only. Never `NEXT_PUBLIC_`. This repo is PUBLIC — never commit credentials or client names.
- Idempotent publishing: unique `(insight_id, platform)` + post-hash dedupe. No deploy on Fridays.
- Milestone reports → `M0_REPORT.md` (public-safe). `TASK_STATUS.md` is local-only.
- The spec wins: read `CONTENT_ENGINE_SPEC.md` before building anything.
